<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-11-22T22:38:33.798Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 22:38:33 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Pakistani security forces killed three TTP-linked terrorists on the outskirts of Peshawar and fifteen terrorists in Mastung district, Balochistan, continuing operations against militant groups. A Pakistani national was critically injured in an Iranian attack, while two Pakistani military personnel were killed and seven detained in Balochistan operations involving the BLA. Near the Iran border, three Afghan migrants, including a woman and a child, were found shot dead. The conflict produced 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxPdnFQazFTVjJaYnluc3pRYzM3M2d4bjZhRWVQVlp4c2lIMjZ0V213Vkh1VmVaaFZ1T1BxRXh6UWxXdC1OSDBOTnVJMnI0b2tlYlhVZnloN2NQZU5FMUxacFExUFItVUNOaS1TSHVjMnRrc05JLWY2MU9NOVJqNmNRUnBhUUUwa2VtejQweHN6WWxvUmF2Und3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE5HYk1yY25QZG5NcWx6UHk2X1FRd3NDMW5xMTA5bzZjYk5yU3l2RHVOeTY5Y0FWSmJmdFBKRkNMRVRGeUhqd2NTTA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE1qSW5nOGRYLVFqM1NzNDhkZWVyZjN1bUR1QVpvZ2NDOVU4eTdpVUFkMUZ4VFpFbnczOUo4cTg1dWEzbUlOY2JQdQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMid0FVX3lxTFB2TnpKbWc3N0FveXdzQUV0Q050Zjg5VUZkcDNWTzE3QTgtR2p0QUhqazJhU2JSSy1IcnpuOTVYeS1zRTYzaU1ZM0NsVGtSMTNqSE9BX1lsUWEzWEFEdlg3ZFhPVF9vVHZYN21OYXptSTFlMG0tMWxV0gF_QVVfeXFMUHRQMnRHSEZjNVVwbUl6UjhzZXhpaE53WUhVckVkbmZoSFpBQ0xVcVVkRHl4ZzFKSTM2MTZuZVdoRXhxT1BvSG1lc3IyWURRYnI3b2tlMnMyWXJKT0I3eGxNRjM5NkFTcUhiUmVBVE9LX3JiOWh6WERUbEpGTkVpVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Express Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New Indian Express&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxPS0xpdnR3UnFIaEJrRmExS1RfT